.env.test.local
.env.production.local
*.pem

# React Native (mobile)
# The native projects under apps/mobile/{android,ios} are SOURCE and are committed:
# bare React Native has no `prebuild`, so permissions, the camera pipeline, Keychain /
# Keystore custody and SQLCipher linkage all live in files that must be reviewable.
# Only their build output is ignored.
apps/mobile/dist/
# apps/mobile/.bundle/config is committed: it pins Bundler's install path for the
# CocoaPods toolchain. Only the installed gems are ignored.
vendor/bundle/
*.jsbundle
.metro-health-check*

# Android build output
**/android/build/
**/android/app/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/.cxx/
**/android/local.properties
*.iml
*.hprof
.kotlin/

# iOS build output
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/build/
**/ios/.xcode.env.local
**/*.xcuserstate
**/xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
*.hmap
*.ipa

